# 🌍 Pulse of Humanity# 🌍 Pulse of Humanity



A real-time world population visualization web application that displays live global population statistics with beautiful animated backgrounds and mobile-responsive design.A real-time world population visualization web application that displays live global population statistics with beautiful animated backgrounds and mobile-responsive design.



