## ✨ Features## ✨ Features



- **Real-time Population Counter** - Live world population with births/deaths tracking- **Real-time Population Counter**: Live-updating world population display with smooth animations

- **Continental Breakdown** - Population statistics by continent- **Interactive World Map**: Visualize global demographic data with interactive geographic components using embedded SVG

- **Mobile Responsive** - Optimized for all screen sizes and touch devices- **Contact Form**: Professional contact system with:

- **Beautiful Animations** - VANTA.js animated backgrounds  - Server-side validation (Flask-WTF)

- **Contact Form** - Rate-limited contact functionality with CSRF protection  - Math captcha spam protection

- **Health Monitoring** - Built-in health check endpoint  - Rate limiting (5 submissions per hour per IP)

- **Security Features** - Rate limiting, security headers, HTTPS redirect  - SMTP email integration via Mailfence

  - CSRF protection and security headers

